484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A Similarity Matrix Model is a powerful tool used to measure the similarity between different data points or items based on some metric or criterion. In this model, a similarity matrix \(often denoted as a square matrix\) is constructed where each element represents the similarity between two data points. This concept is widely applied in domains like collaborative filtering for recommendation systems, clustering, text mining, etc.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
485 0 obj
<<
