/K [5]
>>
endobj
488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1112 0 R
/ActualText (Cosine Similarity: Measures the cosine of the angle between two vectors. Useful for direction rather than magnitude.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
489 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1113 0 R
/ActualText (Euclidean Distance: Measures the straight-line distance; lower values indicate higher similarity.)
