/ActualText (In the Surprise Library, Singular Value Decomposition \(SVD\) is a matrix factorization technique used in collaborative filtering. The SVD model predicts the rating a user uuu would give to an anime iii by factoring both users and items \(anime\) into lower-dimensional latent factor spaces. The model combines the global average rating, user and item biases, and latent factors to generate the prediction.)
